 "summary": "Seven glass passivated rectifier diodes in the DO-214AA (SMB) surface mount package, alike in every figure except reverse voltage, which runs from 50 V (S2AB) to 1000 V (S2MB). Each carries 2.0 A average forward current and takes a 50 A single 8.3 ms half sine surge. Forward drop is 1.0 V max at 2.0 A; reverse leakage is 2.0 µA max at rated voltage and 25 °C. Listed applications: general rectification and freewheeling in power supplies, inverters and converters for consumer and telecom equipment.",
